<BaseLayout seo={{title:'Privacy Policy — GAME//BRIEF',description:'How GAME//BRIEF collects, uses and protects your information.',path:'/privacy'}}><section class="container max-w-3xl py-10"><p class="kicker">Trust</p><h1 class="text-5xl font-black">Privacy Policy</h1><div class="prose-gb mt-6"><p>This policy explains what information GAME//BRIEF collects when you use the site, and how it's used.</p><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>If you subscribe to our newsletter, we collect and store the email address you provide, along with the date you subscribed and where you subscribed from. We don't require an account or collect payment information to read the site.</p><h2>How we use it</h2><p>We use your email address only to send the GAME//BRIEF newsletter and related operational messages (such as confirming your subscription). We do not sell or rent your email address to third parties.</p><h2>Unsubscribing</h2><p>Every newsletter email includes a way to unsubscribe. Once you unsubscribe, we stop sending you emails and mark your record as inactive in our system.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>The site may use basic, privacy-respecting analytics to understand traffic patterns and improve the site. We do not use this data to build advertising profiles of individual readers.</p><h2>Third-party content</h2><p>Some images and media on the site are served through third-party infrastructure (such as our image hosting provider). These providers may log standard technical data like IP address as part of normal content delivery.</p><h2>Your rights</h2><p>You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal data we hold about you by emailing <a href="mailto:officialbeyondsense@gmail.com">officialbeyondsense@gmail.com</a>.</p><h2>Changes to this policy</h2><p>We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected on this page with an updated effective date.</p><p class="text-sm text-muted">This policy is provided as a general reference and has not been reviewed by legal counsel. If you need this policy to meet specific regulatory requirements (such as GDPR or CCPA), please have it reviewed by a qualified lawyer before relying on it.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
